{"4329160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Critical Descent", "steam_appid": 4329160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE PERFECT LANDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Descent is about mastery and precision. Pilot the world's most powerful rocket through the final moments of flight to stick the landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/80bcad1e6f4d2494e37b3083b9a23c93.poster.avif?t=1788276883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/80bcad1e6f4d2494e37b3083b9a23c93.webm?t=1788276883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/80bcad1e6f4d2494e37b3083b9a23c93.mp4?t=1788276883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLY, FAIL, LEARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 75 handcrafted levels, each demanding precise maneuvers through their different scenarios, such as windy storms or a pitch black night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/6c9211650c0faf35accc0b0c940c02ca.poster.avif?t=1788276883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/6c9211650c0faf35accc0b0c940c02ca.webm?t=1788276883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/6c9211650c0faf35accc0b0c940c02ca.mp4?t=1788276883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two difficulty modes, each with their own challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade mode</strong> for those who want a more approachable experience, complete with automatic chopsticks and smart throttling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation mode</strong> is for those who want more of a challenge, with fully manual controls and tighter landing constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot both the massive Super Heavy booster and the more agile upper stage. Attempt landings across Earth, the Moon and Mars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/2a03298e66da786bb61c0fb87550074d.avif?t=1788276883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras_big/2a03298e66da786bb61c0fb87550074d.webp?t=1788276883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGNED FOR ALL DEVICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on your Steam Deck or your PC, with full controller and keyboard support, as well as adaptive UI and text scaling, compatible with all aspect ratios. Critical Descent is optimized for all devices, from the handheld Steam Deck to ultrawide monitors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPETE FOR THE BEST TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against yourself or on a global leaderboard for the best time. Race your own best attempt as a ghost to defeat it and get a new record. Download and race the world record in real-time to see if you can compete.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE PERFECT LANDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Descent is about mastery and precision. Pilot the world's most powerful rocket through the final moments of flight to stick the landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/80bcad1e6f4d2494e37b3083b9a23c93.poster.avif?t=1788276883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/80bcad1e6f4d2494e37b3083b9a23c93.webm?t=1788276883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/80bcad1e6f4d2494e37b3083b9a23c93.mp4?t=1788276883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLY, FAIL, LEARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 75 handcrafted levels, each demanding precise maneuvers through their different scenarios, such as windy storms or a pitch black night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/6c9211650c0faf35accc0b0c940c02ca.poster.avif?t=1788276883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/6c9211650c0faf35accc0b0c940c02ca.webm?t=1788276883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/6c9211650c0faf35accc0b0c940c02ca.mp4?t=1788276883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two difficulty modes, each with their own challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade mode</strong> for those who want a more approachable experience, complete with automatic chopsticks and smart throttling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation mode</strong> is for those who want more of a challenge, with fully manual controls and tighter landing constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot both the massive Super Heavy booster and the more agile upper stage. Attempt landings across Earth, the Moon and Mars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras/2a03298e66da786bb61c0fb87550074d.avif?t=1788276883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/extras_big/2a03298e66da786bb61c0fb87550074d.webp?t=1788276883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGNED FOR ALL DEVICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on your Steam Deck or your PC, with full controller and keyboard support, as well as adaptive UI and text scaling, compatible with all aspect ratios. Critical Descent is optimized for all devices, from the handheld Steam Deck to ultrawide monitors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPETE FOR THE BEST TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against yourself or on a global leaderboard for the best time. Race your own best attempt as a ghost to defeat it and get a new record. Download and race the world record in real-time to see if you can compete.</p>", "short_description": "Master the hardcore, Starship-style catch maneuver in Critical Descent. Pilot massive boosters and agile upper stages across 75 handcrafted levels on Earth, the Moon, and Mars. Featuring global leaderboards, multiple difficulties, and a realistic physics system, for the ultimate landing experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/e6d295e9d061edcd6ba111452f56b7b2e499caf2/header.jpg?t=1788276883", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4329160/71d606bf460e284727662d3a4b97845cc897815e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788276883", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shar